   AXOLR II (08-Oct-96) by Shaman/Diverse
    - very cool onliner with many options
    - stdio (dos) door, usable with any
      good bbs software.
--------------------------------------------

 This is maybe best and almost perfect stdio based onliner around, it
 uses RAW mode to  parse user's  line, converting IBM charset special
 characters  to ISO (amiga)  format, and  convert's SF7->ISO too. All
 features  can be  disabled or enabled  using UNIX-style command line
 flags.  The looks of this wall  ain't any eLItE-cRApsHit!, it's only
 cOOl but pertinent. Try it!

